{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "12db58784e3336594243a6bc91e9a23ad6f3077ed0c4b0380c34f7efdcf9f119", "ja": "（今日は亜利沙のポスター撮影。亜利沙は\nいつになく自然体で、スムーズに進んだ……）", "zh": "（今天是亚利沙的海报拍摄。亚利沙难得地表现得很自然，拍摄顺利地进行着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1001_p", "source_sha256": "29e7f4d12998682d2ca618068ff784c83666f030854de5cd7a1dd10a01415835", "ja": "亜利沙、お疲れさま！\nすごくいい感じだったぞ。", "zh": "亚利沙，辛苦了！\n感觉特别棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "e9f6c712ba6615d645d0cd0174eebf3462d2fad9d436a0b600c1893fd815c4cc", "ja": "頑張りましたよぉ！　爽やかな海をバックに\nした画像は、アイドルちゃんの登竜門ですからね！", "zh": "我可是努力过了哦！以清爽的大海为背景拍摄的照片，可是偶像的登龙门呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "2d7b8a26ba6ab43221ecccabbab56a60072c9616807484735cc0abb5fbdc121c", "ja": "ムフフ♪　{$P$}さんと、\n綿密に下見しておいてよかったです！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　能和{$P$}先生一起仔细踩点，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5dea284f7525965662222b17ec1333520bd927c58c14f41e07a1d3c0a10e4cf3", "ja": "そうだな。亜利沙、随分落ち着いてたし。\n先に歩き回っておいて正解だったな。", "zh": "是啊。亚利沙刚才镇定多了。提前到处走走果然是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "0795f0b35afd4f336a0b22aac7d4e032910b919543e6bec04680e214a06a13b6", "ja": "はい！　それに……何度でも言いますケド、\nここって、アイドルちゃん撮影の聖地なんですよ！", "zh": "是的！而且……这句话我说多少遍都不嫌多，这里可是拍摄偶像们的圣地啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "e4af85521a29d8613cc676f8fe4c37df3565ef7568cc260c996a47518568fdfd", "ja": "前から一度、来てみたいと思っていたんです。\nでも、今日は時間が取れないってわかっていたので。", "zh": "我之前就一直想来一次。不过，我知道今天抽不出时间来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "4c8b20377071baf0ec619cd50b3d3f04b91a97263d4aa38190d65886e51238b9", "ja": "だから、事前にじっくり見て回れて、\nありさはとっても幸せでしたよぉ！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "所以能提前仔细参观一番，  \n亚利沙真的特别幸福哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e9bbfbfe26afc0c5853ef26b2f45f9e86caa33ddd8fc211f7c16e3d01fcccb0a", "ja": "そうか、それならよかった。\nけど……下見のときは、ごめんな。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。\n\n不过……之前踩点的时候，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "640c049511e8976503789adda8a0965fed2d6dc9d34122a6acc19f6b2fd2943e", "ja": "えっ、あっ……ど、どうして\n{$P$}さんが謝るんですかぁ。", "zh": "诶，啊……为、为什么要由{$P$}先生道歉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1010_p", "source_sha256": "91c8d916c6587a520deb215e73cb95544ef442f714862b2f14196f1c1e7c0bcb", "ja": "だって、靴擦れさせちゃったし。\n無理して歩かせちゃったんじゃないかって。", "zh": "因为害你磨破了脚，还让你勉强走了那么久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "25be7ba2d0ba1bb12a6c676893f47790a7acaeda967529f9eb4131a023c15df7", "ja": "ああっ、そんな！　あれはありさがはしゃいで、\n履き慣れない靴で、うろうろしたせいなので……。", "zh": "啊，别这么说！那是因为亚利莎太兴奋了，穿着不习惯的鞋子到处走动，才会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "0587fc4d1c82df6a69cc44755b097f0fd78ce06b30e5900ebfbaa0c47a534945", "ja": "それに、ありさの方こそ……。\nえっと……迷惑かけちゃいましたよね？", "zh": "再说，明明是阿利沙才……呃……给你添麻烦了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1013_p", "source_sha256": "330d7c030d4df9050199c69a76f64a54b75b16e8e90bff133a51e746205cc9a7", "ja": "全然そんな事ないよ。\n亜利沙ひとりおんぶするくらい、軽いもんだ。", "zh": "完全没有那回事。\n背着亚利沙一个人，对我来说轻松得很。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "967e72a534018c965c3ac5e2fa50656705d17615a6b7219d3d4a232e738a756a", "ja": "ひゃ、ひゃああぁ……。\nで、でもでも、最近レッスンで筋肉が……じゃなくて！", "zh": "呀、呀啊啊啊……  \n可、可是可是，最近练习让肌肉变得……不对，不是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "453ec6f67d899ebf35de56e6a2acc0fa43ab0d7b6f96459a12b3edf90074f0ad", "ja": "せっかくの聖地なのに、ありさのせいで\nイヤな思い出になっちゃったんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "难得来到圣地，我却害怕因为亚利沙，让这里变成了不愉快的回忆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fc1891c80d150d5ae7b63f71d923aaae6f04cfe21610f29bf33feb8ed3854aa6", "ja": "いや、じゅうぶん楽しかったよ。\nいい思い出になった。", "zh": "不会，玩得很开心哦。\n留下了美好的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "3d1a0a13d0705634c4cae66c48c53baa21f373266240766fe1d8e64314c7ab52", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか……？", "zh": "真、真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1018_p", "source_sha256": "43af8caebab5f95c7bf64fceef890c744bc5403cf7aef0f4c5274152c0560ac1", "ja": "ああ。亜利沙にとっては、\nちょっと痛い思い出になっちゃったかもだけど。", "zh": "嗯。对亚利沙来说，\n或许成了一段有点痛苦的回忆吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "2da7d851884f671971a1af4d55a9c0f1c548906ca822fdf0d1906730c8c0c255", "ja": "そ、そんな事ありませんよぉ。だって……。\n……えへへ。ありさも思い出、できました！", "zh": "没、没那回事啦。因为……  \n……嘿嘿，亚利沙也留下回忆了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "a30390fafddd7e8285d169910723188f18faaa5917e4e8c5c386ad069a8d9bda", "ja": "今のありさの、この気持ち……。\n今日の写真に少しでも残せてたら、いいと思います！", "zh": "如果今天的照片能多少留下现在的亚利沙的这份心情……那就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6aed4b0693dcd8b70982cb600155c6a11b011f9269abc3475c59d6df05230821", "ja": "そうだな、いいポスターになると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊，我觉得会成为一张很棒的海报。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "79c7f15eb7ea34144c2a69a337f484b3ff7fbbc369db3d7bec99f48ee46c3960", "ja": "あ、あのっ……{$P$}さん！\nよかったら、また付き合ってください！", "zh": "啊、那个……{$P$}先生！\n如果可以的话，请再陪我一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0234_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "f4a2fcb4e0d914d423503c400b12b5ef4adc75d5249c4abfaa31bbd3c20bdbcf", "ja": "アイドルちゃんの聖地は、まだまだありますから！\nありさと全国制覇ですよぉ！　ムフフ……♪", "zh": "偶像们的圣地还有很多呢！和亚利沙一起制霸全国吧！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
